   "html_text": "⟦M⟧ is an enabling condition of the initial project of determining whether ⟦M⟧ , which is opaque with respect to the very premise ⟦M⟧ . It follows from this that ⟦M⟧ is also an enabling condition of the second project. For if ⟦M⟧ were unfulfilled, you couldn’t learn ⟦M⟧ and, a fortiori, you couldn’t learn anything else— ⟦M⟧ included—by inference from ⟦M⟧ . Another consequence is that ⟦M⟧ is an enabling condition of the second project that is opaque relative to the very outcome that ⟦M⟧ . Suppose",
